  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fire Plain grotto-heaven’s Gu Immortals name the move when their heavenly spirit, a rabbit that had been dazed and slow after devouring a nine heavens fragment, jumps around screeching in fear and panic. Fang Yuan has forced a huge entrance with heaven form. They take the spirit’s unease as a warning whenever the grotto-heaven faces danger, and they have never seen it in such a wild mood.",
      "chapters": [
        2107
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_fire_plain_grotto_heaven",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fire Plain true inheritance, recovered as the original copy in Fire Plain grotto-heaven rather than from Fire Plain Grotto Lord, holds this killer move. It is a fire path killer move with human path effects, quite valuable to Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        2108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-path-with-human-effects",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_fire_plain_true_inheritance",
        "char_fire_plain_grotto_lord"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the fight against two venerables, black fire appears in Fang Yuan’s sovereign immortal aperture. A human path formation using the thousand wish tree and Human Sea produces white light that dissipates it, but cannot match the fire’s growth. Fang Yuan’s main body takes a chance to retreat after Qi Sea clone and Zhan Bu Du move. He activates the immortal killer move to save the human path formation first, then coordinates with that formation against the scattered black fire. Burning white flames shroud the black fire and start tearing it apart. The black fire’s growth is immediately impeded.",
      "chapters": [
        2205
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
